                <pb facs="0500" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg396"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">362.1113 Velz, Roland/6: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany (Dodd) to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-10-17T16:00:00+01:00">October 17, 1933—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 17—11:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>171. My 168, October 15, noon. Neurath informed me this morning that the two
                    assailants of Velz came before a summary court yesterday and were this morning
                    sentenced to 6 months imprisonment each.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodd</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
